WEBVTT

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.726
And about our human flourishing together.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.708
And all of us are needed for that.

00:18:35.417 --> 00:18:38.476
Racism wants to stay invisible.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:40.101
Expose it.

00:18:40.125 --> 00:18:42.434
Racism wants your silence.

00:18:42.458 --> 00:18:44.268
Make a noise.

00:18:44.292 --> 00:18:46.559
Racism wants your apathy.

00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:50.809
Make a commitment now to use your voice

00:18:50.833 --> 00:18:53.018
and your privilege and your power

00:18:53.042 --> 00:18:56.768
to fight for racial justice always,

00:18:56.792 --> 00:19:02.226
and to join the crescendo of voices
calling for change.